{"pin":"BB00147","subcodes":[{"code":"BB00147","anchor":"","title":"Du'a'i yawmi nisfi sha'ban","first_line":"Glorified art Thou, O my God! I and all things bear witness that verily Thou art God, and that there is none other God but Thee, alone, without peer. Thine is the creation and the command; Thou givest life and causeth death, and verily Thou art the Ever-Living Who dieth not. Within Thy grasp is the dominion of all things; Thou createst what Thou willest [3.5s]... ...Glory be unto Thee, O Lord! Although Thou mayest cause a person to be destitute of all earthly possessions… O Lord! Provide for the speedy growth of the Tree of Thy divine Unity… Ordain for me, O my Lord, and for those who believe in Thee","first_line_orig":"بسم الله الامنع الاقدس. سبحانک اللهم لاشهدنک و کل شیء علی انک انت الله لا اله الا انت وحدک لا شریک لک لک الخلق و الامر یحی و یمیت و انک انت الحی لا یموت فی قبضبتک ملکوت کل شیء یبدع ما یشاء  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"1300","subjects":"@prayer for martyrs, @justice and wrath of God, @Manifestation of God as tree of life; sadratu'l-muntaha, @chastisement and requital, @power and sovereignty of God; omnipotence of God","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swb","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of the Báb","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"type":"swb","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of the Báb","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BYC_pray.121.17-126.07","source":"BYC_pray","locator":"121.17-126.07","url":"http://bayanic.com/lib/scan/sacred/Point/Pray"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"MKI4494.017","source":"MKI4494","locator":"017","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/MKI-34-Ae-Arabi-4494.pdf"},{"kind":"music","code":"B. Lisbeth","source":"B","locator":"Lisbeth","url":"https://bonnielisbeth.bandcamp.com/track/o-lord-provide"},{"kind":"music","code":"Bonnie \u0026 Noor","source":"Bonnie \u0026 Noor","url":"https://youtu.be/RRbqO0iB7NA"},{"kind":"publicatio